	(text "06 CTLR0 / EIP / VALVE — SHOP DRAWING (bar A). Magenta dashed = TEMP USB only.\nValve: GPIO4 -> VO14642AT -> 2900299 (CR1) -> VUVG-L10-M52-AD-M7-1R8L (energize=close).\nKGG 100-80 air ports not on this sheet. E1/E2/E7 still OPEN."
